00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:21.010
Son. The cabbage sprouted.

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:23.245
I grew these sprouts. I did it all by myself.

00:04:23.245 --> 00:04:24.813
I collected poop and...

00:04:25.981 --> 00:04:27.049
- Dad. - Yes?

00:04:27.449 --> 00:04:28.584
Ji Sang and Ji Gu...

00:04:29.818 --> 00:04:30.986
They're gone.

00:04:30.986 --> 00:04:32.354
Sure.

00:04:32.354 --> 00:04:34.690
No. Ji Sang Gu...

00:04:35.391 --> 00:04:36.625
