00:04:43.332 --> 00:04:44.199
The bus...

00:04:45.567 --> 00:04:46.702
Ji Gu...

00:04:47.603 --> 00:04:48.637
Ji Gu.

00:04:49.805 --> 00:04:50.806
Seong Ji Gu.

00:05:04.019 --> 00:05:05.020
Ji Sang.

