00:05:40.456 --> 00:05:41.457
Ji Sang.

00:05:43.792 --> 00:05:44.827
Ji Sang.

00:05:45.794 --> 00:05:47.396
It's time. Why aren't we leaving?

00:05:47.396 --> 00:05:48.697
Mister. Why aren't we leaving?

00:05:48.697 --> 00:05:51.533
