Did our goats run away again?

00:08:42.204 --> 00:08:43.238
That's a problem.

00:08:43.238 --> 00:08:46.275
Mat Story's middle and youngest children ran away.

00:08:47.276 --> 00:08:50.479
Every kid has a cell phone these days.

00:08:50.479 --> 00:08:52.915
