00:10:13.028 --> 00:10:14.463
No. None.

00:10:14.463 --> 00:10:15.831
No.

00:10:15.831 --> 00:10:17.266
Then it's probably not kidnapping.

00:10:23.539 --> 00:10:24.473
Passports.

00:10:27.509 --> 00:10:29.244
