Officer Park.

00:11:32.274 --> 00:11:33.409
These are your kids, right?

00:11:34.343 --> 00:11:37.212
Who is this man? Why is he with my sons?

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:41.250
The livestock barn owner didn't recognize them...

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.719
