00:11:47.823 --> 00:11:49.792
We thought it was a runaway case...

00:11:49.792 --> 00:11:52.328
What? Our kids ran away?

00:11:52.328 --> 00:11:53.996
We checked with the bus terminal.

00:11:53.996 --> 00:11:55.631
Ji Sang did buy bus tickets to Daegu,

00:11:55.631 --> 00:11:56.832
but neither of them got on the bus.

00:11:57.633 --> 00:12:00.469
Take your truck and head into town.

00:12:00.469 --> 00:12:01.904
I will search more thoroughly around here.

00:12:01.904 --> 00:12:03.639
Officer Park, keep me updated.

00:12:03.639 --> 00:12:04.406
- Okay. - Okay.

00:12:06.608 --> 00:12:08.544
I think something happened to the two of them.

00:12:08.544 --> 00:12:11.113
I have go there myself. I...

00:12:11.847 --> 00:12:14.483
