00:12:40.976 --> 00:12:42.845
- Search thoroughly. - All right.

00:12:44.046 --> 00:12:45.147
Ms. Cho Mi Ryeo.

00:12:45.481 --> 00:12:47.750
Ms. Cho Mi Ryeo. Look at me, okay?

