00:13:16.679 --> 00:13:17.579
Ji Gu.

00:13:19.581 --> 00:13:20.449
Ji Gu.

00:13:23.118 --> 00:13:23.986
Ji Gu.

00:13:25.254 --> 00:13:26.388
Seong Ji Gu.

