00:15:29.345 --> 00:15:30.212
Okay.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.887
- Hold on to me. - What?

00:15:44.793 --> 00:15:46.562
If you don't hold tight, you'll fall.

00:15:46.562 --> 00:15:47.463
Hold on tight.

00:15:52.067 --> 00:15:53.669
