00:17:10.212 --> 00:17:11.113
This...

00:17:12.214 --> 00:17:13.148
Ji Sang.

00:17:13.515 --> 00:17:14.416
Ji Gu.

00:17:15.017 --> 00:17:16.018
Seong Ji Sang.

